300
00:19:05,860 --> 00:19:06,880
How strange.

301
00:19:07,180 --> 00:19:08,886
None of this makes any sense.

302
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:18,197
this isn't reality i
must be hallucinating or

303
00:19:18,280 --> 00:19:23,100
else it's someone else's
doing no way stop it

