00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:42,637
a dream was that all a dream

305
00:19:42,720 --> 00:19:46,240
but when did I start dreaming

306
00:19:50,500 --> 00:19:55,120
looks like i really did beat up that
guard though i guess that's real

307
00:19:56,860 --> 00:20:01,657
this is a photo of john Gloria that's the

308
00:20:01,740 --> 00:20:05,857
same one that dad showed
me he told me about

309
00:20:05,940 --> 00:20:08,697
the accident with the hitchhiker how john

