322
00:20:53,120 --> 00:20:58,120
From the moment we stepped into this
visitation room, we fell into a trap.

323
00:20:58,900 --> 00:21:01,194
And I've been hallucinating ever since.

324
00:21:02,840 --> 00:21:07,080
Slowly but surely, as if we were
sitting in a huge snake's stomach,

325
00:21:07,700 --> 00:21:09,280
